  "title": "Luxurious Sweet Vietnamese Beef Bo Kho",
  "description": "A rich and flavorful Vietnamese beef stew made with passata and deglaze fond, perfect for a solo dinner, and sugar free friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
